## Why This Is Asked
This tests practical design for large dashboards with multi-tenant feature flags, dynamic loading, and performance.

## Key Concepts
- Memoized per-widget visibility selectors (reselect)
- Virtualized grid rendering for 150 widgets
- Context + Redux for flags and global UI state
- useTransition for burst updates; React.memo for widgets
- Accessibility: keyboard nav, ARIA labels

## Code Example
